@page
@model HydroSentinel.Pages.AboutModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About Firmlon"; }

<div class="page-redesign about-page">
    <section class="rd-section rd-about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="shell"><p class="rd-kicker">About Firmlon</p><h1 id="about-title" class="rd-hero-heading">Building smarter water solutions.</h1><p class="rd-hero-lede">Firmlon Smart Solutions Ltd. focuses on practical technology solutions that help make water management clearer, more manageable, and better suited to everyday needs.</p><img class="rd-about-image" src="~/images/water-infrastructure.jfif" alt="Wide water-treatment infrastructure beside a green landscape" width="1364" height="768" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><p class="rd-note">Editorial infrastructure imagery. This photograph is not presented as a Firmlon office or facility.</p></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="about-story"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><div><p class="rd-kicker">The problem space</p><h2 id="about-story">Water systems are practical systems.</h2></div><div><p>Water storage, pumping, and supply are part of everyday life for homes, businesses, and facilities. When the information around those systems is difficult to see or discuss, management becomes more reactive.</p><p>Firmlon is developing practical smart-water technology around that reality. HydroSentinel is the intended smart water pump controller within that work, designed to support clearer awareness of the system and the decisions around it.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-soft" aria-labelledby="values-title"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Working principles</p><h2 id="values-title">Values we are proposing.</h2></div><p>These values are proposed brand language and remain subject to confirmation by Firmlon.</p></div><div class="rd-values"><article class="rd-value"><h3>Innovation</h3><p>Explore useful ideas that make a practical difference.</p></article><article class="rd-value"><h3>Reliability</h3><p>Build solutions intended for real-world conditions.</p></article><article class="rd-value"><h3>Sustainability</h3><p>Support more considered water and energy management.</p></article><article class="rd-value"><h3>Customer focus</h3><p>Keep the people using the system at the centre.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="mission-title"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><figure class="rd-editorial-media"><img src="~/images/pump-installation.jfif" alt="Industrial pump-room infrastructure with a person reviewing a phone" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Contextual engineering imagery; not a Firmlon staff or premises photograph.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="rd-kicker">Proposed mission</p><h2 id="mission-title">Make water management easier to understand and act on.</h2><p>We propose a mission centred on making water management more manageable, reliable, and efficient through appropriate technology and thoughtful product design.</p><p class="rd-approval">Mission wording is proposed and pending approval by Firmlon.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-dark"><div class="shell rd-cta-row"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Product development</p><h2>Engineering around the connected water system.</h2><p class="rd-dark-copy">HydroSentinel is intended to bring the controller, pump, tank, and user's monitoring view into one clearer story.</p></div><a class="button button-light" asp-page="/Contact">Contact Our Team <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
</div>
